            "content": "Okay, the results on my DeepSeek V4 Flash benchmark are now complete on @VulcanBench.\n\nAnd wow, was not expecting this.\n\nThis is also why I think it's so important to benchmark across effort levels.\n\nDeepSeek took the top spot, but not with high effort with Medium effort, Grok 4.5 Medium is now in number two.\n\nFable got bumped out of the top three.\n\nAnd ChatGPT isn't in the top five any more.\n\nFull benchmark results below, report will be added to the VulcanBench site early this week.",
